  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gBbFK1h.png\" width=\"1315\" height=\"685\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCc_kqzt253fnG2RHW_CZL2A\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCc_kqzt253fnG2RHW_CZL2A?label=Youtube&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"138\" height=\"22\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/sketch_macaw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/- -ffffff\" width=\"15\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/sketch_macaw?color=6eb7ec&amp;label=Twitter&amp;logo=twitter&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"119\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/- -ffffff\" width=\"15\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Jmpdj8W\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/645360921673465857?color=a97db2&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=f&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"181\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/sketchmacaw/MacawsModsIssues/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/- -ffffff\" width=\"15\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-Crafting Recipes-bc8f56?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"154\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GUtHhCc.png\" alt=\"blueline\" width=\"1920\" height=\"17\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/A1pclRa.png\" alt=\"about\" width=\"162\" height=\"43\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我们都知道《我的世界》需要更多有风格的栅栏、墙和大门。那么，我猜我给你带来了好消息！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">这个模组添加了新的木栅栏、大门、石墙、石质大门，以及特殊的带刺栅栏（可造成伤害）。最新的1.1.0版本新增了石柱墙、<br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">草顶石墙和碰撞时造成伤害的\"Cheval De Frise\"（鹿砦）！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">欢迎在评论区或我们的Macaw Discord上提出你的想法。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GUtHhCc.png\" alt=\"blueline\" width=\"1920\" height=\"17\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zQ7I8me.png\" alt=\"video\" width=\"340\" height=\"47\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">最新的栅栏视频展示</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/g3V3lcidXmU?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/mqOR-HOaI68?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fsketchmacaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Macaw/BH_MxBH_PromoCard.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"647\" height=\"144\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">需要服务器吗？点击上方图片，使用我们的优惠码 <strong>sketchmacaw</strong>，首月即享 <strong>25%</strong> 折扣，畅快游玩！</p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GUtHhCc.png\" alt=\"blueline\" width=\"1920\" height=\"17\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EpKoS1L.png\" alt=\"faq\" width=\"163\" height=\"50\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">问：你有计划将模组回溯移植到1.15.2及更低版本吗？</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">答：可能性很小</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">问：我能在我的整合包中使用你的模组吗？</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">答：可以，只需注明鸣谢并附上CurseForge页面链接即可</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">问：我有翻译稿想提供给你，该发到哪里？</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">答：可以通过GitHub或我们的Discord服务器发送</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BOmxXoM.jpg\" width=\"1903\" height=\"2399\"></p>",
